3). Analyzing TeamPCP’s Supply Chain Attacks: Checkmarx KICS and elementary-data in CI/CD Credential Theft. Retrieved July 16, 2026.", "source_name": "Trend Micro TeamPCP MAY 2026", "url": "https://www.trendmicro.com/en_us/research/26/e/analyzing-teampcp-supply-chain-attacks.html"}], "id": "relationship--5065baaf-7a17-47b4-9880-73c834029e69", "modified": "2026-07-31T18:47:43.572Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "intrusion-set--20f26558-e05d-46cf-8847-c2b5a83ee779", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "attack-pattern--88d31120-5bc7-4ce3-a9c0-7cf147be8e54", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-24537', 0, 234, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', 'A7913D719E8CD0A3C6668F6B6D9DF58D2C88CAE68C4237A19478168263424FAB', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
