P MAR 2026", "url": "https://www.sysdig.com/blog/teampcp-expands-supply-chain-compromise-spreads-from-trivy-to-checkmarx-github-actions"}, {"description": "Unit 42. (2026, March 31). Weaponizing the Protectors: TeamPCP’s Multi-Stage Supply Chain Attack on Security Infrastructure. Retrieved July 1, 2026.", "source_name": "Palo Alto TeamPCP MAR 2026", "url": "https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/teampcp-supply-chain-attacks/"}], "id": "relationship--dcf4b2a4-22ed-451d-b0db-92fa4a11c3b7", "modified": "2026-07-31T18:47:43.948Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "intrusion-set--20f26558-e05d-46cf-8847-c2b5a83ee779", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "malware--fe5b2f0f-8fdc-459d-85b7-dd45c0217a0c", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-24556', 0, 249, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', 'FC339472B6EB8603FECCA9D0FA2B13C4190F3C068DEA0A882FD58DEDAFA393A0', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "STRUCTURED_DATA"}')
